# Club & Grub - World 4, stage 2 co-op: "Obsidian Keep" for two (designer DB3; docs/expansion/DESIGN.md D.9,
# LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.7). The co-op file of levels/w4_l2.lvl (kind = coop, coop_of, coop_base_hash; never edit the
# solo file): the fortress on the volcano - the ash road, the gatehouse, the great hall, the column staircase and
# the ramparts - for two. Expert only, as the solo stage.
# Co-op gates:
#  - "plates": a leapfrog in the great hall (DESIGN.md D.5 [G9]). A masonry wall crosses the hall with two corridors,
#    each shut by a door at the end far from its plate: A stands on plate pa (11 cells before the lower door) and
#    the lower corridor opens for B; B walks through to plate pb behind the wall and the upper corridor (its door
#    10 cells from pb) opens for A, who climbs the slabs over pa to it. The plates are 14 cells apart, so both
#    heroes stay on one view. A plate counts only a hatched, active hero: one player cannot park his partner on it.
#  - "drums": the spiked portcullis on the ramparts rises (for good) only when its twin drums are struck within the
#    window - one on a ledge by the portcullis, 4 rows up, the other by the keep tower 14 columns back, the spike
#    well between them (no single throw line crosses both: G36).
# Traits: a Shaman shields the keep guards of the far rampart (the Shellback turtle, the lone rex of the hill); two
# Raptors keep the hidden armory; the harriers and stingers are loners (they keep away from a pair that sticks
# together). The x2 secret: the keep tower, 8 rows over the rampart (Shoulder Hop), with Cave Painting 28. A
# checkpoint behind each gate.

[meta]
format = 2
id = w4_l2_coop
name = "Obsidian Keep"
kind = coop
coop_of = w4_l2
coop_base_hash = "4440fc43fcca436877c595997a99d98d86dc77e8084b61b30695fc509162708f"
book = 1
world = 4
stage = 2
biome = volcano
terrain_a = volcano/terrain_obsidian
terrain_b = volcano/terrain
liquid = lava
background = volcano
music = level_volcano
min_difficulty = expert
next = w4_l2b
tally = false
bonus_tier = 2
author = DB3
notes = "Co-op 4-2: leapfrog plate doors in the great hall, twin drums under the spiked portcullis, Shamans, Raptors, the keep tower (painting 28)."

[legend]
a = items/food index=46
b = items/food index=43
c = items/food index=45
d = items/food index=33
e = items/food index=40
C = objects/checkpoint
E = objects/exit
H = items/heart
Q = objects/hidden_spot kind=small count=3 look=inset tile=% contents=food:40,food:35,treasure:3
q = objects/hidden_spot kind=small count=3 look=inset tile=# contents=food:33,food:43,treasure:6
k = objects/hidden_spot kind=small count=3 look=inset tile=# contents=food:45,food:46,treasure:5
K = objects/hidden_spot kind=small count=3 look=inset tile=% contents=food:43,food:33,food:46
# The big spot in the orange road before the lava pits (the default '*' is a '#' cell: an obsidian block in it).
Z = objects/hidden_spot kind=big hits=3 tile=%

